            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A cleaning device (20) and a cleaning system. The cleaning device (20) comprises a cleaning base body (21) and a device body (22) which are pivotally connected. The device body (22) comprises a first sensing assembly and a sewage tank (25). The sewage tank (25) is detachably connected to the device body (22). The sewage tank (25) comprises a sewage tank body (251), a first floater and a second floater (2541), the first floater and the second floater (2541) being arranged in the sewage tank body (251).</p>
            </abstract>
